@@ -21,6 +21,10 @@ A rental period is `[start, end)`: both timestamps must be midnight UTC, and
 when it overlaps another booking for the same item; periods that only touch at
 their boundary are permitted. Booking IDs are assigned in creation order.
 
+Rentals lasting three days or more receive a 10% discount on their full price.
+Both quotes and bookings return this discounted total in euro cents. When the
+discounted amount falls between cents, it is rounded to the nearest cent.
+
 The service has no cancellation operation yet. When it is added, the school
 policy is a full refund at least 24 hours before the booking start and no refund
 after that point.
